# Quick Context Reference

## Project: Konfequem - Room Booking System
Type: Django + React room booking application

### Stack
- Backend: Django 4.2 + Django REST Framework
- Frontend: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind CSS
- Database: PostgreSQL (prod) / SQLite (dev)
- Auth: JWT tokens

### Key Features
✓ Room listing with capacity/location
✓ Time-based booking system (08:00-22:00 Berlin time)
✓ Booking validation (15 min - 8 hours, max 90 days ahead)
✓ JWT authentication
✓ Responsive UI with card components

### Business Rules
• No overlapping bookings
• Office hours only: 08:00-22:00 (Berlin timezone)
• Min duration: 15 minutes
• Max duration: 8 hours
• Max advance booking: 90 days

### Ports
- Local backend: 8000
- Local frontend: 5173
- Local DB: 5432
- Docker DB: 5433

### Important Files
• Backend: backend/rooms/ (models, views, serializers)
• Frontend: frontend/src/ (components, context, pages)
• Config: docker-compose.yml, .env

### Recent Changes
- Unified design system (Card, Button, Typography)
- Enhanced room cards with badges
- Improved booking list UI
- Alert system added
- Header UX improvements

### DB Models
- Room: name, location, capacity (1-50)
- Booking: room, user, start_time, end_time

### API Structure
- /api/rooms/ (read-only, public)
- /api/bookings/ (auth CRUD)

### Quick Commands
```bash
# Start with Docker
docker-compose up --build

# Backend (local)
cd backend && pip install -r requirements.txt
python manage.py migrate && runserver

# Frontend (local)
cd frontend && npm install && npm run dev
```

### Note
- Use .claude file for full details
- Use DEV_GUIDE.md for development procedures